From b00cadb38b981cbf61c10acb37721af396eab091 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 13:33:59 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Native: a finger-sized pager on paged lists

In the touch layout the battle lists and the field menu's Psynergy and
item lists show the item menu's 16 by 16 arrows as the UI kit's lists
page: up (previous page) over the small left arrow on the top border,
down (next page) at the bottom right, each taking taps over 24 by 24.
The field lists' pages now turn by touch. GBA ROM unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
